From 3c29a74ff2fb273259663c71d64d6de7df0bf835 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MYIR <support@myirtech.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] camera: fix STM32MP25 OV5640 preview

The STM32MP25 DCMIPP graph exposes dump, main, auxiliary and metadata
video nodes. Selecting the first /dev/video node and the shortest media
graph path therefore picks the raw dump pipe instead of the main ISP
pipe required to debayer OV5640 frames.

Prefer dcmipp_main_capture, configure the OV5640 raw mode used by the
reference camera scripts, scale at the main postprocessor, and support
the little-endian RGB565 format exported by the DCMIPP capture driver.
Only cache media setup after at least one pipeline was configured so a
failed first attempt can be retried.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [STM32MP25 board integration]

Signed-off-by: MYIR <support@myirtech.com>
---
